</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RE01UC_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8O00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze frame data. The freeze frame data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000RE01UC_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000RE01UC_13_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8P00000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (Stop Light Switch)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), operate following the screen display and select [ECU Data Monitor] - [Stop Light SW].</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Read [OFF → ON] displayed on SST (TaSCAN) when the brake pedal is operated (released → depressed).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>[Diagnosis menu screen: Powertrain → Engine → ECU Data Monitor]</title>
<tgroup cols="4" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
<ptxt>[Symbol]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Item Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Reference Value</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Stop Light SW</ptxt>
<ptxt>[STP]</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Indicates the stop light switch status</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Brake pedal released → depressed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>OFF→ON</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0006" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0002" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RE01UC_13_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8Q00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Stop Light Switch Assembly - Battery)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the stop light switch assembly connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A056986J11" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.08in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.05in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>2 (B) and 3 (B) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>11 to 14V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RE01UC_13_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8R00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Stop Light Switch Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.29in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.84in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Between terminal 1 - terminal 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft not pushed in (brake pedal depressed)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Between terminal 3 - terminal 4</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A072924J11" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals when the shaft is pushed in (brake pedal not depressed).</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.29in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.84in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Between terminal 1 - terminal 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry morerows="1" valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shaft pushed in (brake pedal not depressed)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Between terminal 3 - terminal 4</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0004" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400000RE01UC_13_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000D8S00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness or Connector (Stop Light Switch Assembly - Engine Control Computer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM0000005D702RX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the stop light switch assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector B of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A158134J03" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the terminals. (see <xref href="X39400000QV01SD" label="Seep01"/> for Terminals of ECU)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<tgroup cols="3" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
<colspec colnum="01" colname="C01" colwidth="0.97in"/>
<colspec colnum="02" colname="C02" colwidth="1.78in"/>
<colspec colnum="03" colname="C03" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B35 (ST1-) ←→ Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Shaft not pushed in → shaft pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>0 to 1.5V→7.5 to 14.0V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry colname="C01" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B36 (STP) ←→ Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C02" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Shaft not pushed in → shaft pushed in</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname="C03" valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>7.5 to 14.0V→0 to 1.5V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0005" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400000RE01UC_13_0009" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
